title: Party Organizations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs_spd
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: party_actions += 1; party_organizations_timer = 6;
card-image: img/Mann_der_Arbeit.jpg
#subtitle: Outside of electoral politics, the SPD runs a social world onto itself.

= Party Organizations

In addition to being a political party, the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> is a social world onto itself, with a vast array of associated organizations which serve the social needs of their members from cradle to grave.

- @newspapers: Fund more newspapers and journalists.
- @welfare: Fund more mutual aid and welfare programs.
- @culture: Fund sports leagues, educational, and cultural programs.
- @rb: Fund the Reichsbanner, our self-defense organization.
- @youth: We have the reputation of being a party for old men. Support the youth organizations.
- @fef: Fund our think tank, the Friedrich Ebert Foundation
- @if: Fund the Iron Front
- @local: Fund Local Branches
- @lablaw: Fund Union and Labour Lawyers
- @spdunion: Fund an SPD-centred union
- @asbd: Fund the ASBD (Arbeiter-Samariter-Bund-Deutschland), a workers and medical aid organisation
- @coops: Fund Co-ops with Party resources
- @fwrelief: Fund Food & Water relief
- @childcare: Fund Childcare programs
- @apprenticeships: Fund apprenticeships with Party resources
- @lenderies: Fund Libraries and other item lenderies
- @eldercare: Fund an SPD-associated Eldercare program
- @dvp_spy: Plant a spy in the DVP's Left-Wing
- @nothing: Do not increase funding for any program.
- @easy_discard

@newspapers
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_timer = 0;
go-to: media



@welfare
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_aid += 1; unemployed_spd += 5*(1 - dissent);

We have increased funding to Workers' Welfare. [? if black_thursday_seen > 0 : In an age of economic crisis, this will be helpful for improving our standing among the unemployed. ?]

@culture
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; cultural_organizations += 1; left_dissent -= 6; center_dissent -= 6; labor_dissent -= 6; reformist_dissent -= 6; neorevisionist_dissent -= 6

It is not enough for the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> to solely be a political party. The Worker Singer's League, Worker's Sports, and our schools and libraries are crucial to our members' lives. Funding these organizations makes our members more committed to the party, even when our policies might not be to their liking.

[? if sa_strength > 500 : However, it feels frivolous to spend on sports and choirs when the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">fascists</span> are murdering us in the streets. ?]

@rb
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
view-if: not rb_explode
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rb_strength  += 100; rb_militancy += 0.01; reichsbanner_timer = 0; funded_reichsbanner += 1

We have increased recruiting to the Reichsbanner.

@youth
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
view-if: not rb_explode
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rb_strength += 50; rb_militancy += 0.02; young_socialists += 1; left_strength += 5; neorevisionist_strength += 5; radicalization += 1;

Our new youth members flock to the left or neorevisionist wings of the party, and also bring new radicalism to the Reichsbanner.

@fef
choose-if: wip = 1
unavailable-subtitle: Coming Soon

- @poled: Fund political education
- @students: Fund scholarships and promote students with outstanding intellectual abilities or personality

