@eldercare
subtitle: -1 resource
on-arrival: workers_spd_growth += 0.1; new_middle_spd_growth += 0.1; unemployed_spd_growth += 0.1; workers_spd += 1; unemployed_spd += 1; eldercare_funded += 1; resource -= 1

We have [? if eldercare_funded > 0: further ?] funded and SPD-associated eldercare programs, ensuring that our older members have a place to stay, and are fed at least one meal everyday. This ensures that older members are more likely to stick with the party, as we may well be supply their house.

@dvp_spy
subtitle: -1 resource
on-arrival: dvp_spy_timer = 6; dvp_spy = 1; resources -= 1

We have planted a spy in the DVP. After he is settled, we can decide how to use his abilities.

@nothing

We do not fund any party organizations.

- @return: Continue...
